&lt;p&gt;    @bzz Thank you for reviewing.&lt;br/&gt;
    I think ```resultRefreshed``` condition causes bug and I don&apos;t know why it needs.&lt;br/&gt;
    @corneadoug @felizbear please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15358502" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 1 Jul 2016 06:45:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user corneadoug commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

